WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.208
At the bottom of the mantle sit two
vast regions where earthquake waves

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:04.758
slow down.

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:08.238
One lies under Africa, and is
nicknamed Tuzo.

00:00:08.688 --> 00:00:11.498
The other, Jason, lies under the
Pacific.

00:00:11.948 --> 00:00:15.773
Each is wider than a continent, and
what they are made of is still argued

00:00:15.773 --> 00:00:16.035
over.
